    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17800" root="زعم" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُعْمٌ</span></b>  [originally an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعَمَ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْمٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِعْمٌ</span>,] is a word used by the vulgar as meaning
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِبْرٌ</span> [i. e. <i>Pride;</i> and, as often used in the present
day, <i>pretension:</i> because implying false, or vain,
assertion]. (TA.)

